<!-- 2026-09-10: Port full-store catalog - one shared file for all 7 locations (4 faction Ports
     + Valencia). Two sections: "Goods" (ore/ingot/tool/consumable/gas/component - identical
     everywhere, faction-agnostic) and "Vehicles" (ship/ground-vehicle grids - Offer only, no
     Order, since MES doesn't buy grids back). Which subset of this one file a given location
     actually offers is controlled per-location by WW2-Store-StoreProfiles.sbc's
     RequiredOffers/RequiredOrders lists, not by anything in this file - see that file's own
     notes. Pricing follows GVK's own convention (GVK-Store-StoreItems-AllItems.xml): matching
     Order/Offer CustomPrice per item, Order MinPriceMultiplier ~65-85 (buy from player, at a
     discount), Offer MinPriceMultiplier ~115-135 (sell to player, at a markup). All prices are a
     first-pass placeholder, not final balance - revisit after playtesting.

     Per direct instruction: Ice is Offer-only (never bought from players) - Water Mod makes
     collected water an effectively infinite, trivial source of Ice, so buying it back would be a
     free-money exploit. -->

